# Effective indices of the full and the shallow-etched slab, and the group index of their mean.
# Reference: root of the three-layer dispersion relation found with SciPy.
title 340 nm silicon slab, air cladding
stack core=0.34
materials clad=air
grating angle=10 etch=0.109
expect n_full 3.10920475 2e-07
expect n_etched 2.86745831 2e-07
expect n_grating 2.98833153 2e-07
expect group_index 3.75115546 0.0002
